<title>POLAND: Exbud in PLN 54 mln deal with Thomson.</title>
<headline>Exbud in PLN 54 mln deal with Thomson.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Exbud SA signed a 54 million zloty contract to complete a production facility for Thomson Polkolor Sp z o.o., Exbud said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the facility, which is due to be completed by March 1, 1998, would be located in the central Polish town of Zyrardow.</p>
<p>Thomson Polkolor is a Polish unit of France's Thomson SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
